WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.418
If you've been working
professionally

2
00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:02.544
in your art form,

3
00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:05.005
you may already be closer to teaching than you think.

4
00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:07.298
California has a special pathway called a

5
00:00:07.298 --> 00:00:11.386
CTE credential, or
Career Technical Education.

6
00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:12.804
And it's designed specifically

7
00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:14.431
for working professionals who want to bring

8
00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:16.099
their real world expertise

9
00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:17.350
into the classroom.

10
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.643
Here's the key requirement:

11
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.318
CTE pathways

12
00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:28.778
are typically faster,

13
00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:30.864
more accessible, and affordable

14
00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.699
than a traditional teaching
credential.

15
00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:34.367
They're built around the idea that your

16
00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.702
professional experience

17
00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.287
is your qualification.

18
00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:40.165
This can be a great fit
for artists, designers,

19
00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:42.542
performers, or industry professionals

20
00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.961
who want to teach without going back to school

21
00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:46.212
for several years.

22
00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.464
Does this sound like you?
